    "UIName": "Prowler MTV (RAF)",
    "Id": "vehicledef_PROWLER_RAF",
    "Name": "Prowler MTV (RAF)",
    "Details": "Originally developed by Vitesse Vehicles of Terra in 2611, the Prowler Multi-Terrain-Vehicle was the most common hostile and exotic environment military-grade exploration vehicles. The Prowler was almost unsurpassed in its niche, the design proving popular enough for Vitesse to halt production and merely license the design to manufacturers across the Inner Sphere and Periphery. While never produced in large numbers, all post–Star League era Successor State militaries maintained a number of the vehicle for combat on their most inhospitable planets.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: None.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 4/6 hexes / 120/180 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Armor\n<b>Structure:</b> Environmental Sealing\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       155     30\n<b>Left</b>         125     30\n<b>Right</b>       125     30\n<b>Rear</b>        100     30\n<b>Turret</b>      125     30\n\n<b>Total</b>      630    150</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Enhanced FPE</color>\n\n<color=#ffcc00> Can carry 1 Battle Armor Squads. Has firing ports.</color>",
    "Icon": "Prowler"
  },
